  "voice": {
    "provider": "reused narration.wav (split at SRT cue boundaries)",
    "clone_alias": null,
    "clone_id_hash": null,
    "lines": [
      {
        "line": 1,
        "text": "但有个坑：网关健康检查探的是写死的默认端口，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line01.wav",
        "duration_s": 5.313
      },
      {
        "line": 2,
        "text": "和 Easel 实际网关端口对不上——那一行，是红的。",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line02.wav",
        "duration_s": 6.52
      },
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "装了 Easel 之后，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line03.wav",
        "duration_s": 2.768
      },
      {
        "line": 4,
        "text": "最先要回答的只有一个问题：",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line04.wav",
        "duration_s": 2.998
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": "它到底跑不跑得起来？",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line05.wav",
        "duration_s": 2.306
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": "更直接的是 Web 工作台这条路：六项没过。依赖没装，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line06.wav",
        "duration_s": 6.459
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": "前端也没构建，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line07.wav",
        "duration_s": 1.675
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": ".env 里也没有 API Key——",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line08.wav",
        "duration_s": 4.545
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": "所以 Web 界面，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line09.wav",
        "duration_s": 2.392
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "到现在还没验证。",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line10.wav",
        "duration_s": 1.914
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "一句话收尾：",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line11.wav",
        "duration_s": 1.243
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "Easel 不是开箱即用的产品，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line12.wav",
        "duration_s": 3.315
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "但它是一个真能被调起来的生产引擎——",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line13.wav",
        "duration_s": 3.729
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "CLI 和 Skill 这条线，",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line14.wav",
        "duration_s": 3.315
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "今天是通的。",
        "path": "project://assets/voice/lines/line15.wav",
        "duration_s": 1.243
      }
    ],
